# Translated from the Apple port's routes/death_rock.route: the PCjr's variable numbers
# (docs/engine.md, "Variables"). Run: kqroute-pcjr DISK routes/death_rock.route
# Death route: the rolling rock (room 3). Moving the rock while standing below it, in the
# path it rolls down (to 113, 147), and it runs Graham over (v6 = 10, the rock).
# Run with: kqroute extracted/disk1.do extracted/disk2.do extracted/disk3.do routes/death_rock.route
room 3
goto 114 128
say move rock
dies 300
